<title>USA: Catellus names Slater non-executive chairman.</title>
<headline>Catellus names Slater non-executive chairman.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Catellus Development Corp said Tuesday it has elected Jacqueline Slater the new non-executive chairman of the board.</p>
<p>Slater has been a director of Catellus since 1993 and most recently served as chairman of the finance committee.  She is the managing director of the Real Estate Finance Group at The Chase Manhattan Bank, N.A. and president of Chase Commercial Mortgage Securities Corporation.</p>
<p>It could not immediately be learned who Slater replaced.</p>
</text>
